1
00:00:00,389 --> 00:00:03,769
(Sheldon:)...that, I maintain, in the right concentration
could be weaponized.

2
00:00:04,810 --> 00:00:07,270
(Penny:)Leonard might come home.
Can we talk in my apartment?

3
00:00:07,813 --> 00:00:09,693
(Sheldon:)We're not done?

4
00:00:11,024 --> 00:00:13,314
(Howard:)- No.
- Eh, why not?

5
00:00:13,485 --> 00:00:16,325
(Sheldon:)We're already through
the looking glass anyway.

6
00:00:19,908 --> 00:00:22,288
(Penny:)Okay, so here's the thing.

7
00:00:22,453 --> 00:00:25,413
(Penny:)I guess you're aware
that Leonard asked me out.

8
00:00:25,581 --> 00:00:27,331
(Sheldon:)Well, he didn't actually say anything.

9
00:00:27,499 --> 00:00:30,419
(Sheldon:)But when he came back to the apartment,
he was doing a dance...

10
00:00:30,586 --> 00:00:33,506
(Sheldon:)...that brought to mind
the happy hippos in Fantasia.

11
00:00:34,173 --> 00:00:36,093
(Penny:)Oh, that's nice.

12
00:00:36,258 --> 00:00:38,508
(Penny:)Anyhow,
the thing I wanted to talk to about is...

13
00:00:38,677 --> 00:00:42,057
(Penny:)...you know, since Leonard
and I have become friends, I was just...

14
00:00:42,222 --> 00:00:43,262
Wanna sit down?

15
00:00:43,807 --> 00:00:46,267
(Sheldon:)Oh, I wish it were that simple.

16
00:00:47,936 --> 00:00:51,686
(Sheldon:)You see, I don't spend much time here,
and so I've never chosen a place to sit.

17
00:00:52,316 --> 00:00:53,776
(Penny:)Well, choose.

18
00:00:53,942 --> 00:00:56,942
(Sheldon:)There are a number of options and...

19
00:00:57,112 --> 00:01:00,022
(Sheldon:)I'm really not familiar enough
with the cushion densities...

